      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of obsolescence, which is a very painful feeling. Remember that the skills and dedication you poured into your craft are not meaningless; they represent a deep well of knowledge and experience. Perhaps there are ways to translate that expertise into something new, even if the form has changed, or to find value in mentoring others. Your journey has built something unique, and that value doesn't disappear just because the industry shifts.",
